### With Interactive Legend DataHead

Legend values update dynamically when hovering over bars:

```tsx
<VerticalMultiBarChart
  data={data}
  interactive={true}
  chartHeaderConfig={{
    chartTitleValue: "Quarterly Revenue",
    chartSubtitleValue: "Hover bars to see values in legend",
