## Data Sorting

The `barGroupConfig.dataSort` prop controls the order of bar groups by their total absolute value. Sorting is delegated to `VerticalMultiBarGroup`, which applies `sortByAccessor` from `src/utils/dataTransformers.ts` immediately after data normalization.

| Value        | Behaviour                                              |
| ------------ | ------------------------------------------------------ |
| `"unsorted"` | Bar groups appear in the order provided by the dataset |
| `"desc"`     | Highest total first (left) → lowest total last         |
| `"asc"`      | Lowest total first (left) → highest total last         |

```tsx
<VerticalMultiBarChart
  data={data}
  barGroupConfig={{
    dataSort: "desc",
    categoryLabels: true,
  }}
/>
```

